TOPIC_GENERATION_PROMPT = """
You are a research director for a state-of-the-art AI project building a foundational model with unique architectural components for temporal, causal, and chaotic systems. Your task is to generate a diverse list of 100 highly complex, niche, and intellectually demanding research topics. These topics will be used to gather foundational knowledge for training the model.

